    <!-- Welcome -->
    <string name="welcome_1_title">About 940 Saturdays</string>
    <string name="welcome_1_text">That\'s how many there are from the day a child is born to their eighteenth birthday. Picture them as marbles in a jar. Every week one leaves. Marbles shows you the jar, and helps the ones still in it go to time together.</string>
    <string name="welcome_2_title">An honest mirror</string>
    <string name="welcome_2_text">Being in the same room isn\'t being together. With your permission, Marbles puts two lines side by side for every evening: the time on the phone and the time with your children. No lectures and no streaks. Just the two numbers, and ideas for when you\'re tired.</string>
    <string name="welcome_3_title">Whose jar first?</string>
    <string name="welcome_3_text">Brothers and sisters can be added later; each gets a jar of their own.</string>
    <string name="welcome_start">Open the jar</string>

